# External implementation mapping for the current SSN/SOSA track.
#
# The premises must be present in the input graph: either asserted directly or
# supplied by a prior reasoning/materialization step. This query performs no
# implicit OWL, inverse-property, or subproperty reasoning. It consumes the
# exact pinned CCO predicates below.
#
# The second constructed direction follows the source-native inverse:
# ssn:implementedBy owl:inverseOf ssn:implements (imports/ssn.ttl).
# This is a one-way materialization rule. It does not decompose an existing
# implements/implementedBy assertion into a prescription or an execution.
#
# Keep this artifact outside the OWL ontology products. In particular, do not
# encode its premises as an owl:propertyChainAxiom or a SWRL rule. Validate
# materialized assertions together with their intended local ontology/ABox.

PREFIX ssn: <http://www.w3.org/ns/ssn/>
PREFIX cco: <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/>

CONSTRUCT {
  ?procedure ssn:implementedBy ?system .
  ?system ssn:implements ?procedure .
}
WHERE {
  # cco:ont00001942 = prescribes; cco:ont00001833 = has agent.
  ?procedure cco:ont00001942 ?execution .
  ?execution cco:ont00001833 ?system .
}
